# Day 15

**15km / 4 hours**

This was a shorter day so I decided to set off a bit later and spent the morning slowly munching on breakfast while watching the morning dew evaporate. Watching grass dry doesn't sound interesting but it was strangely captivating given just how much dew there was. This also mattered since plenty of it was soaking the outside of my tent so I had an interest in that drying off.

![The views from the top](./views.jpg)

After that it was back to the good old road walking. This was most of the day except right at the end where I got onto a nice track for a little bit right before a big walkway tomorrow. This white section hasn't been great and most of the planning has been related to getting to the next bit but that's okay. 

![The view of the calm river in the sunset](./sunset-view.jpg)